    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the nick of time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is the child okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me see. All four limbs attached, no external wounds... does it hurt anywhere?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_762_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ouch... your armor's spiky...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 40,
        "ystrength": 40,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Oops, sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_759_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My child!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frenetic Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_762_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mom!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_759_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you... Thank you so much for saving my child!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frenetic Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay away from the forest. There are wild beasts in the area, and they're increasing in numbers. It's not safe here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yato... I don't think they came out here because they wanted to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No! There's netting between the village and the forest. I reinforced it myself not long ago. How could there be beasts here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to go take a look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down. Has the evacuation started?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_759_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... There's no evacuation. The mine exploded, the sky started burning... there's nothing left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frenetic Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_759_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone's running. We all panicked when we heard that beasts were coming, but we don't know where to go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frenetic Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why is it so chaotic? What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_759_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I tried to pull Naoki away from the crowd, but then a bunch of them ran straight at us. Naoki was gone by the time I caught my breath.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frenetic Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Someone intentionally damaged the netting, letting in the beasts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ano yarou... Where is Takii?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_759_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The headman is\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frenetic Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snarl_2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snarl_1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here they come again, Corne!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll hold them off with my shield... Argh, whatever, a sword's fine!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kashiwau, please take these two to a safe place and see if you can help out in the village. Corne and I will stop the beasts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't need you to tell me that. Let's go Mirai... Mirai?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1030_noirc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think she already went in.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noir Corne"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "36_g2_easternvillageB",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could it have come so quickly? Wasn't it supposed to take more time for the Catastrophe to form?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Noshige, Inoue, get everybody together and take them to the shelter I told you about! It's safer there. We'll evacuate as a group once we have everybody!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good thing we'd prepared for this day... What you said came true again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's burning...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Despondent Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The mountains are covered in smoke... the sky's on fire... the mine's gone...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Despondent Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing? Grab your things and get out of here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My livelihood, my life, it's all gone...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Despondent Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Headman... will we have to go back to our old life, now that the mine's all burned up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Despondent Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now's not the time for that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gone... everything's gone...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Despondent Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you panicking like that? The Catastrophe isn't even here yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snarl_2",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snarl_1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Beasts! The beasts are coming!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicking Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Beasts! And so close! What happened to the protective netting?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ritou, get over here! What's going on over there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Headman! The netting on the west side is broken! The beasts are in the village! What do we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What in blazes is going on here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everybody, calm down! Take the bare minimum of what you need, gather at the shelter in the northeast, and wait for evacuation! The beasts can't get in there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Headman... why is there a shelter in the village?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you already know this was going to happen?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This... happened because you closed the mine, didn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "H-Headman?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicking Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Headman!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What you on about, Ritou? You know that isn't true!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is no time to be fooling around! Lives are at stake here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't just stand there, folks! Head to the shelter!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, this is important! Everything we've worked for is gone! We need justice!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did the mine have to be closed? Why did this disaster happen right afterward?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-Yeah! You closed it for 5 days out of the blue for a 'maintenance check,' and now the mine's gone, and the whole mountain is burning!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Panicking Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you close the mine and keep the truth hidden from the others because of that monster that showed up down there? Is that the cause of this disaster?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "text": "We could have worked together to deal with it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was <i>your</i> idea to keep it a secret, to prevent a panic.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And don't think I don't know about your little side business. I know how much you've pocketed ever since your family started handling the transactions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you have the slightest bit of conscience left, stop delaying the evacuation!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then how do you explain the shelter? You must have planned this in advance... You're the one who wants to hoard the wealth of the mine all to yourself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You even blew up the cave... You killed those two doctors who came to investigate the Oripathy!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Headman...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Inoue"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you do, Headman?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Noshige"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not you too... Ritou...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I'll admit I've wanted to close the mine for a long time. I knew that overexploitation of the mine was bound to bring disaster. The shelter was built in preparation for this day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why? Because we're over-reliant on Originium mining. Originium particles have already entered the environment. The danger has been slowly building for a while now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was only a matter of time before Catastrophe struck and we'd have to abandon the mine, but I couldn't get everyone to give up on it before. We all benefitted too much from the Originium trade.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That day simply came a little sooner than expected, that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And yes, I closed the mine because of that unknown creature.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You all know that I used to be a hunter. I judged that it wasn't something we could easily handle, and we couldn't afford to fight it in the tunnels.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ishidori and the others have already been infected with Oripathy. People would have died if we'd continued to dig. The responsibility for all of your lives falls on my shoulders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Which is the same reason I'm telling you to evacuate now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mine or not, the most important thing is that we're alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But then things would go back to how they used to be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cold nights... howling in the forest... blood, cold, hunger... fear... no! I don't want to go back to that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So what if we're alive?! Where's the hope? I'd rather die than go back to living like that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you saying... get ahold of yourself!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's right! We won't go back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was you who got us started on mining Originium in the first place! It's all your fault!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You ruined everything!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've ruined the village! Ruined all our lives!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This man must be made to pay! We all agree, don't we?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough of this!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a Catastrophe right on your doorstep!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haven't we already paid enough of a price? Are we going to lose even more lives just for this meaningless venting?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mirai! Why are you back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh look, another troublemaker. The apple doesn't fall far from the tree.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The frightened beasts are heading down the mountain, the netting's been sabotaged, and someone's trying to stir up chaos...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All to force us to wait for death in despair, and abandon the hope we could have had.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And we still <i>can</i> have, away from the Originium mines, without having to rely on hunting either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why I came back from the city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Liar! You were the one who wanted to close the mine and ruin our lives!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, because Originium is dangerous and hard to control. I even considered blowing up the mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I also understand that we owe our livelihood to it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember back when we were trying to climb out of poverty? Were we in despair then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was it really the Originium that got us to where we are today?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We seized our chance to escape poverty because we had the determination to look for a way, and the courage to expose ourselves to Originium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y... Yeah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since ancient times, hunters have made a living by fighting beasts, back when there was no Originium. Many of them died, but we survived as a people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Courage and hope come hand-in-hand. And we've never abandoned our courage...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So hope will always appear by our side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't listen to her! She was the one who wanted to close the mine! And now she's <i>destroyed</i> the mine, she practically admitted it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Mirai only tried to convince us to close it because overexploitation would cause a Catastrophe. And now that really happened...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stout Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were wrong to doubt her...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tall Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're familiar with the plant in this flask, aren't you? Among the goods that we trade with the outside, the Suzuka herb is second only to Originium in terms of trade volume.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It only grows in certain areas, and in small numbers. We've had to risk life and limb to harvest it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I came back to study the possibility of cultivating it, and planting it outside its native habitat. This one I'm holding right here is my greatest breakthrough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It can survive outside of these mountains. It's the first brick that will lay the foundation of our future as a village.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But first, we need to survive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Survive...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, what were we thinking? We fought so hard to get to this point. We can't just die here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "No Longer Angry Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No! We'll lose all our income without the mine\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_757_1#1$1"
    },
    {
