        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown1",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Aah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who... gah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hiroshi Ritou"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#6$1",
        "fadeitme": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$MH_epvspinout"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Open your mouth again, and I'm sticking your head in the mud.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This entire conversation is a waste of time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This man damaged the netting, tried to lure in beasts to cause chaos, then distracted everyone from what was going on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "While on the other side of the village, he had some people moving his assets out, something he clearly planned ahead of time. I've already taken care of them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You will now head to the shelter in an orderly line and await evacuation. Reinforcements from Rhodes Island will be arriving soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, you can walk there yourselves, or I can knock you out and have someone else carry you. Choose.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_761_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er... thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mirai Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a beast outbreak, and they're approaching the village. That's the biggest threat we're facing right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1029_Yato2_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll handle the beasts. I can't guarantee we'll get all of them, but we'll do what we can to ensure your safety.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yato"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, please stay here and protect the evacuating villagers. You're the only ones who can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And take care of Mirai for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Headman! Where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "No Longer Angry Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm the headman of Roka Village, and the leader of its hunters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_753_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The beasts have emerged from their forests, so I'll fight them to my last breath, even if I'm on my own!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ataru Takii"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Honey, take Tsuyumaru to the shelter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "No Longer Angry Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_758_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I think I left my machete in the backyard?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "No Longer Angry Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_759_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, it's there... come back safely!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sad Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The headman's always treated our family well. It's high time we repaid him!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stout Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, we're with him, whether it's in the mines or in the forests. We've always been hunters. Take up your spears!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tall Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll protect our own village and our own families!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tall Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "Headman! Wait for us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stout Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going too!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bald Villager"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mom, didn't dad said there were no hunters anymore?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frightened Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, Sumiko. The hunters have always been here, ready to step forward whenever danger approaches.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Resolute Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph... and now they're putting on a show. They're no hunters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Yoshitaka Kashiwau"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_755_1#5$1"
    },
    {
